WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.690
Wakeel. Your firm's WhatsApp, answered and organised.

2
00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:09.570
Scan one QR code, and your firm's existing number is linked.

3
00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:16.990
Publish fees, hours and intake questions. It answers only from those.

4
00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:23.571
Clients write as usual. First, it says it's an assistant, not a lawyer.

5
00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:30.060
It replies in English, Urdu, or Roman Urdu, matching each client.

6
00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:36.941
Fee and office-hour questions are answered from your library, with the source shown.

7
00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:42.501
Voice notes are transcribed, and it can reply with a voice note too.

8
00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:50.161
An arrest, or a tight deadline, stops the bot and opens an escalation.

9
00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:57.971
The assigned lawyer is alerted in the dashboard, the browser, and on WhatsApp.

10
00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:02.501
Facts from the chat fill in the matter record automatically.

11
00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:10.291
Request an FIR copy or a CNIC, and track what has arrived.

12
00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:17.120
Your lawyer gets a brief: what's known, what's missing, and the next step.

13
00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:24.020
Anything beyond an approved answer waits for a lawyer's approval.

14
00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:31.780
Hearings and consultations sit in one diary, synced to Google Calendar.

15
00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:38.060
WhatsApp calls are answered, and missed calls get a follow-up message.

16
00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:46.380
Payment proofs from JazzCash, Easypaisa or a bank are verified against the matter.

17
00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:51.000
And you can see exactly how your front desk is performing.

18
00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:58.570
AI assists. Your lawyers decide. Wakeel.

